{% block subject %}[{{ guest.system_company.name }}] Order action failed: {{ failure.action|default('')|title }} #{{ failure.order_id|default('') }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
{# ClientFence: sent once when an order action opens a new failed action (ClientFence\Mod\Order\ActionFailures). #}
{% set failure = failure|default({}) %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<style type="text/css">
		body {
			font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
			font-size: 14px;
			color: #333333;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 24px;
			font-weight: bold;
			margin: 0 0 20px;
		}

		p {
			margin: 0 0 10px;
		}

		strong {
			font-weight: bold;
		}

		pre {
			white-space: pre-wrap;
			background: #f5f5f5;
			padding: 10px;
		}

		.signature {
			font-style: italic;
			color: #999999;
			margin-top: 20px;
			border-top: 1px solid #cccccc;
			padding-top: 10px;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<h1>Order Action Failed</h1>
	<p>Hello {{ staff.name|default('') }},</p>
	<p>The <strong>{{ failure.action|default('') }}</strong> action of order <strong>#{{ failure.order_id|default('') }} {{ failure.order_title|default('') }}</strong>{% if failure.client_name|default('') %} (client <strong>{{ failure.client_name }}</strong>){% endif %} failed. Its hosting panel, registrar or other service refused it or could not finish it.</p>
	<p>Error:</p>
	<pre>{{ failure.message|default('') }}</pre>
	<p>Fix the cause, then retry the action from Orders &gt; Failed actions, or dismiss it there if it was done by hand. Nothing is retried on its own. Further failures of the same action are counted there without another email.</p>

	<p><a href='{{ failure.order_url|default('') }}' target="_blank">Manage order</a> | <a href='{{ failure.list_url|default('') }}' target="_blank">Failed actions</a></p>

	<div class="signature">{{ guest.system_email.signature }}</div>
</body>
</html>
{% endblock %}
